</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O height I cannot reach!</l><l>O depth I cannot sound!</l><l>O love, O boundless love,</l><l>In my Redeemer found!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I live—and yet not I,</l><l>But Christ that lives in me,</l><l>Who from the law of sin</l><l>And death has made me free.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
